            "notes": "### Core Changes\n\n*Most Important Stat: [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)*\n1. Take [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422)\n     - This is the best choice for our build to start of with as it allows us to extend the duration of our packs, this generates a **lot** of cash in the early rounds if you are able to land your whipshots. \n     - Pack your tank whenever appropriate and spam whipshot the enemy tank for easy value.\n2. Buy [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) and [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295).\n3. Buy whichever common survival item you prefer.\n\n### Playstyle\n\n- Prioritize survival above all else, in the early game dying costs you a significant amount of income. Stay with your backline and save your Shield Bash to escape the enemy.\n\n- When your team is starting to win a team fight (your team secured a pick or two) only then should you bash in and help with cleanup, any assists and eliminations you can safely secure will contribute to your total income.\n\n- Remember to maximise [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422), constantly apply repair packs to your tank and land as many whipshots as possible.",
