            "notes": "### Core Changes\n\n*Most Important Stat: [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)*\n\n1. Take [Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8)\n    - [Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8) is everything to this build, apply packs to gain a ludicrous amount of self healing.\n2. Sell everything\n3. Buy [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7)\n    - [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) enables you to exist on the frontline and derive value from swinging on people. Do not substitute this for any other item.\n4. Buy [Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8)\n    - Powerful survival item for our build.\n5. Buy [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)\n    - For this round continue to stack [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) \n\n### Missing/Spare Cash\n\nIf you are unable to afford [Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8), or have extra cash to spare you first buy as many [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) items as possible. \n\n### Playstyle Changes\n\n**This round changes your playstyle dramatically.**\n\n- You will now want to play aggressively from now on, position yourself relative to where your tank is. When they engage, you engage. When they backup, you backup. Match their tempo. Try to stay alive. The longer you live the more money you can make.\n\n- REMEMBER TO USE [Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8)!!! This build crumbles when this is not taken advantage of. Make sure you apply repair packs to your allies (primarily your tank) **before** engaging. The more people you have packs active on the more healing you will benefit from, upwards to 15% max life per second. Please, make sure to take advantage of this.\n\n- Whipshot often! [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422) synergizes with [Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8) naturally, the longer your repair packs last the longer you can heal off of them. Be mindful not to boop away the target you are trying to swing on, or you will not be able to heal yourself via [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7). Either whipshot a target nearby or use it to finish off your target.",
