            "notes": "### Core Changes\n\n*Most Important Stat: [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)*\n\n1. Take [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8)\n       - Completes our build, synergizes insanely with [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422) and [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4)\n2. Sell [Nullifier Neuroworks](item_6501be99-b951-4dad-9bb5-8305eb17d84e)\n3. Buy [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4)\n    - Generates rally insanely efficiently, paired with [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) we can generate 12% ult charge per cooldown cycle.\n\n### Missing/Spare Cash\n\n[Ability Power](stat_ability_power) [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) !!!\n\n### Playstyle Changes\n\nThis round is where you take off in power.\n\nEvery single time you bash -> melee -> whipshot, you generate 15% ult charge and 5 seconds to your repair packs. This allows you to get INSANE uptime on your packs and generate rally incredibly fast. You are now a raid boss. Bash into them as frequently as you can and take advantage of the bonus damage afforded by [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8). Run. The. Lobby.",
