            "created_at": "2025-09-10T13:30:03.719877+00:00",
            "notes": "### Core Changes\n\n*Most Important Stat: [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)*\n\n1. Take one of:\n    - [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0)\n       - At this point in the game we have around 600~HP, this power allows us to generate extra sustain for our teammates, synergizes amazingly with [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8).\n    - [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee)\n       - Allows us to get rally faster and proc tons of inspire in ult.\n    - [Burst Aid](item_a676ca4f-264e-46b1-8a4a-9aa732b95eae)\n       - This power should only be taken if you are **the** carry of the team. Use this as a get out of jail free card when needed, as the health regenerated is a disgusting amount.\n     - [Righteous Cleave](item_fa98450c-b553-431d-997a-60fe2b0abb51)\n        - Provides burst healing on your melee, consider taking if you need the extra healing in the final round.\n2. Buy [Three-Tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429)\n    - Synergises with [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb), builds your [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed).\n\n### Playstyle Changes\n\nWelcome to the final round!\n\nThis is going to be a drawn out round, primarily by you as this build is all about being disgustingly high sustain.\n\nFocus on building your rally as soon as possible to win fights, it easily is the highest impact you can offer on [Brigitte](hero_8d4e7c27-fb70-4694-9721-2ecf094ef84a),  [Dragons' Incinerator](item_d0794681-844b-4ce8-9857-15320f35a634) is an amazing item to exploit, so make sure you do it often!!\n\nAside from that, play as you have been and good luck on winning!",
